    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">BST invariant (range DFS)</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/validate-binary-search-tree/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 98</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Validate Binary Search Tree</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Checking each node against its parent is not enough: a node must fit the open interval set by all of its ancestors. Pass (lo, hi) down the DFS and tighten one bound per step, or check that the in-order sequence is strictly increasing. O(n) time, O(h) stack.</p>\n"
